{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_allies2.gif?t=1744447050\" />   <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_enemies2.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something strange is afoot in the small rustic Norwegian town of Skogdal... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_commandoHandshake.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a deckbuilding card game where you have to explore a large hand-crafted world across multiple runs. Immerse yourself in this weird but familiar adventure, and uncover an unsettling Carpenter-esque mystery\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_karmaChoice.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skogdal offers more than 300 different cards for you to discover and draft. Fuse cards, build powerful combos and recruit followers to aid you in your journey: politicians, bodybuilders, wrestlers, pyromaniacs, skaters, punks, priests, pets and pests\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_superRoundhouse.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...good luck, the truth is out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_pizzaSlices.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2452820?t=1744447050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744447050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/39d606954b05d6d17f078655bb7806fb5bfe0cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744447050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/39d606954b05d6d17f078655bb7806fb5bfe0cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744447050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is meant to reflect the lives of young adults, containing dark humor, crude language and cursing, references and imagery of alcohol and insinuated drug use. No explicit violence. Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages."},"demos":[{"appid":2731700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_allies2.gif?t=1744447050\" />   <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_enemies2.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something strange is afoot in the small rustic Norwegian town of Skogdal... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_commandoHandshake.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a deckbuilding card game where you have to explore a large hand-crafted world across multiple runs. Immerse yourself in this weird but familiar adventure, and uncover an unsettling Carpenter-esque mystery\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_karmaChoice.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skogdal offers more than 300 different cards for you to discover and draft. Fuse cards, build powerful combos and recruit followers to aid you in your journey: politicians, bodybuilders, wrestlers, pyromaniacs, skaters, punks, priests, pets and pests\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_superRoundhouse.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...good luck, the truth is out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/extras/gif_pizzaSlices.gif?t=1744447050\" /></p>","developers":["Erlend Kirkeboe","Kay Arne Kirkeboe"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452820/header.jpg?t=1744447050","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123124,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123124/movie480.mp4?t=1744035646","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123124/movie_max.mp4?t=1744035646"},"name":"Final Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123124/e0f9058e4628ad5bb6456ac8eb